This directory contains additional Amiga-oriented test programs and
helpers used when exercising the port.

The main Python regression suite lives under Lib/test.
Amiga-specific automated checks live under Source/AmigaTests/ for
the 2.7.18 port.

Legacy scripts here were folded into AmigaTests/test_legacy_amiga.py:
  test_argparser.py  -> test_argparser_*
  test_misc.py       -> test_crc32_vectors (IEEE vectors for Amiga/crc32.c),
                       test_touch_and_dates
  test_links.py      -> test_links_optional (skips without root/links)
  as.py              -> ARexx+socket host demo (not a unit test)

Also: _amigados.ArgParser had a types.append bug (two args); fixed so
the ArgParser suite can run.

Scripts here may still be run manually; they assume classic Amiga path
syntax, Dos/amiga helpers, and (where relevant) ARexx or networking.
